cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use Crypto Service Suite in research or software, please cite it as below."
type: software
title: "Crypto Service Suite: A comprehensive TypeScript cryptography toolkit"
abstract: >-
  A unified TypeScript cryptography toolkit providing 50+ classical, modern,
  and post-quantum algorithms (ML-KEM, ML-DSA, SLH-DSA), REST microservice,
  CLI, React hooks, Vue composables, ORM adapters, Edge runtime support,
  Model Context Protocol (MCP), Language Server Protocol (LSP), CBOM generation,
  and benchmark suite across 18 lockstep packages.
authors:
  - family-names: Rousseau
    given-names: Sebastien
    email: sebastian.rousseau@gmail.com
version: "0.0.27"
date-released: "2026-10-09"
license: "Apache-2.0 OR MIT"
repository-code: "https://github.com/sebastienrousseau/crypto-service"
url: "https://crypto-service.co"
keywords:
  - cryptography
  - post-quantum
  - typescript
  - ml-kem
  - ml-dsa
  - slh-dsa
  - encryption
  - fastify
  - mcp
  - lsp
  - cbom
  - cyclonedx
